[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="BiomeProfile" format=3]
; Layer 3, the foundry: near-neutral basalt and iron under a plain key light, a warm haze far behind, lit up close by what
; burns in it (the NieR furnace, docs/references/nier-factory-furnace.png): slag and heat in the molten ember-gold, the only
; saturated marks; the decor accent warmed from the frozen rose to coral.

